# Line-ending policy (BUG-017).
#
# The deployment integrity model hashes module bytes in three places: locally
# (tools/Get-Hashes.ps1), in CI (manifest job), and at runtime (launcher.ps1
# hashing what raw.githubusercontent.com serves). SHA-256 over text is CRLF/LF
# sensitive, so all three parties MUST see identical bytes. GitHub raw serves
# the committed blob, which in a normalized repo is LF -- therefore *.ps1 is
# pinned to LF in the working copy too, on every platform.
#
# After adding or changing this file, run:  git add --renormalize .
* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=lf
